WEBVTT

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.220
Kaoru Akashi, Aoi Nogami,
and Shiho Sannomiya.

00:00:12.691 --> 00:00:16.252
BABEL's Level 7 special espers: The Children.

00:00:38.717 --> 00:00:42.554
Possessing a boost which let them
break Black Phantom's brainwashing...

00:00:42.554 --> 00:00:45.023
I'm genuinely intrigued.

00:00:45.023 --> 00:00:46.581
Shall we investigate?

00:00:46.658 --> 00:00:47.750
Of course.

00:00:53.198 --> 00:00:56.565
The Middle East - Comerican Military Base

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.435
It's from Black Phantom!

00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:04.843
"Well done on your mission.
Your next playground is Japan."

00:01:04.843 --> 00:01:06.606
"Have fun."

00:01:07.278 --> 00:01:08.880
Japan, huh?

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.643
That's a country with fun toys!

00:01:11.316 --> 00:01:13.113
I've always wanted to check it out!

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:25.589
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:01:26.598 --> 00:01:32.468
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:34.906 --> 00:01:40.708
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:41.046 --> 00:01:45.915
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:47.185 --> 00:01:52.714
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:53.124 --> 00:01:57.720
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:58.329 --> 00:02:01.232
Limiter (changing myself)

00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:04.360
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:10.236
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:02:11.676 --> 00:02:14.245
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:02:14.245 --> 00:02:17.078
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:02:17.315 --> 00:02:23.481
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:02:23.621 --> 00:02:26.424
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:02:26.424 --> 00:02:29.060
Sora e karitateru yo

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:34.794
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:40.662
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:49.747 --> 00:02:52.511
42nd sense:
Combination Complication! Fantastic Toy!

00:02:59.224 --> 00:03:01.392
Goodbye. I have to go.

00:03:01.392 --> 00:03:04.429
But I promise, I'll come back, Aoi!

00:03:04.429 --> 00:03:06.264
I believe you, Kaoru!

00:03:06.264 --> 00:03:07.765
Give it a rest.

00:03:07.765 --> 00:03:09.767
Just come back soon, Kaoru.

00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:12.070
See you in hell... I mean, goodbye!

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.435
Hurry up!

00:03:14.038 --> 00:03:16.407
She'll be back by nightfall.

00:03:16.407 --> 00:03:17.942
Let's go, Kaoru.

00:03:17.942 --> 00:03:18.670
Okay!

00:03:19.177 --> 00:03:20.645
See you, girls.

00:03:20.645 --> 00:03:22.078
See you later!

00:03:22.714 --> 00:03:24.841
She's going to the Fuji Research
and Development Center?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:25.984
Yeah.

00:03:25.984 --> 00:03:28.077
They said they're giving Kaoru a physical exam.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.554
Why?

00:03:29.554 --> 00:03:31.723
They said it was to be safe.

00:03:31.723 --> 00:03:32.781
To be safe?

00:03:33.424 --> 00:03:35.255
Incident in undersea tunnel!

00:03:35.693 --> 00:03:37.923
Special espers, move out!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.031
Hey! All all finished!

00:04:01.386 --> 00:04:02.854
Queen...

00:04:02.854 --> 00:04:04.185
Minamoto!

00:04:04.422 --> 00:04:05.446
Learn anything?!

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:05.957
My eyes! What are you doing?!

00:04:05.957 --> 00:04:07.992
Oops. Sorry.
My eyes! What are you doing?!

00:04:07.992 --> 00:04:08.549
My eyes! What are you doing?!

00:04:09.727 --> 00:04:12.330
But how often are we all alone like this?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.128
I'll tell Aoi and Shiho on you.

00:04:16.935 --> 00:04:19.704
There's nothing physically wrong with Kaoru.

00:04:19.704 --> 00:04:21.763
I see. Thanks, Sakaki.

00:04:22.173 --> 00:04:24.576
So why spring the exam on me like this?

00:04:24.576 --> 00:04:26.344
We've been checking your limiter to see...

00:04:26.344 --> 00:04:28.676
how it's been affected since
using the Triple Boost.

00:04:29.314 --> 00:04:32.016
When we did, we learned that
the rare earth metal crystal...

00:04:32.016 --> 00:04:34.507
that forms the heart of the
equipment is changing.

00:04:35.253 --> 00:04:36.117
It's just to be safe.

00:04:36.621 --> 00:04:39.647
I'll be done soon, so just wait
and read a magazine, okay?

00:04:41.492 --> 00:04:42.254
Okay.

00:04:44.295 --> 00:04:46.456
Sakaki, let me see her chart.

00:04:47.832 --> 00:04:48.560
Sure.

00:04:54.505 --> 00:04:56.874
Since the limiter's crystal was altered,

00:04:56.874 --> 00:04:59.577
it's now responding far above specifications.

00:04:59.577 --> 00:05:00.407
What?

00:05:00.912 --> 00:05:05.316
This crystal could potentially be
used to link up every esper!

00:05:05.316 --> 00:05:09.309
Incredible. But isn't that too risky to try?

00:05:09.654 --> 00:05:11.556
I think you know.

00:05:11.556 --> 00:05:13.990
She is the esper messiah!

00:05:14.892 --> 00:05:19.163
You, a Normal, are helping
to give birth to the queen.

00:05:19.163 --> 00:05:20.460
As you always shall.

00:05:24.702 --> 00:05:27.939
Yoshimi's boobs have gotten even bigger!

00:05:27.939 --> 00:05:29.736
I can't stand it!

00:05:31.309 --> 00:05:34.142
No. I refuse to accept what Hyobu said.

00:05:35.647 --> 00:05:36.443
Minamoto?

00:05:37.849 --> 00:05:40.841
Holy cow! It's a whole fleet of them!

00:05:43.855 --> 00:05:46.424
"Is your exam over, Kaoru?"

00:05:46.424 --> 00:05:49.594
"We're going on a mission with Naomi."

00:05:49.594 --> 00:05:51.721
Quit trying to steal him from us and join the fun!

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.065
I envy how close you guys are.

00:05:54.065 --> 00:05:55.733
I'd like some teammates, too.

00:05:55.733 --> 00:05:56.631
Hey!

00:05:56.734 --> 00:05:56.968
"Ogasawara-Style Sortie Standby Posture"
- Quiet smile.
- No talking.
- No eating or applying makeup.
- Arms and hands should rest lightly atop the hip.
- Legs must remain together at all times!
- If anyone sees your panties, KILL YOURSELF AT ONCE!

00:05:56.968 --> 00:05:59.637
"Ogasawara-Style Sortie Standby Posture"
- Quiet smile.
- No talking.
- No eating or applying makeup.
- Arms and hands should rest lightly atop the hip.
- Legs must remain together at all times!
- If anyone sees your panties, KILL YOURSELF AT ONCE!
No personal texting on a mission!

00:05:59.637 --> 00:05:59.871
Decorum must be maintained
while awaiting the mission.

00:05:59.871 --> 00:06:01.606
I'm also jealous of your supervisor.
Decorum must be maintained
while awaiting the mission.

00:06:01.606 --> 00:06:02.630
This is the proper way to sit.
Want to throw him out?

00:06:03.574 --> 00:06:04.563
I can see it.

00:06:10.848 --> 00:06:12.450
This is awful!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.652
At least I don't see any dead or wounded!

00:06:14.652 --> 00:06:16.051
But what about inside?

00:06:16.354 --> 00:06:17.622
Get the fire out first!

00:06:17.622 --> 00:06:20.792
That fire will burn Naomi's fair, soft skin!

00:06:20.792 --> 00:06:22.487
Don't talk about my skin!

00:06:36.874 --> 00:06:37.704
What?

00:06:39.344 --> 00:06:41.012
A giant robot?

00:06:41.012 --> 00:06:42.877
You're The Children?

00:06:44.182 --> 00:06:46.377
You brought some fun toys to play with.

00:06:46.918 --> 00:06:48.853
Just like Black Phantom said.

00:06:48.853 --> 00:06:49.911
Black Phantom?

00:06:50.555 --> 00:06:53.353
I want them, so let's play.

00:06:54.492 --> 00:06:57.052
Word of warning, though:
my toys are pretty strong.

00:07:04.402 --> 00:07:05.733
Black Phantom?!

00:07:06.204 --> 00:07:08.139
Understood! As fast as we can!

00:07:08.139 --> 00:07:09.674
Black Phantom again?

00:07:09.674 --> 00:07:10.441
Yeah.

00:07:10.441 --> 00:07:12.844
Without you, we can't break
the enemy's brainwashing.

00:07:12.844 --> 00:07:15.142
The boost needs the powers
of all three of The Children!

00:07:16.247 --> 00:07:17.348
Didn't you see?

00:07:17.348 --> 00:07:20.952
With one shot, she freed him from
brainwashing which even I couldn't break.

00:07:20.952 --> 00:07:23.554
That wasn't just her drawing
power from her friends.

00:07:23.554 --> 00:07:26.045
She instinctively forged an entirely new one.

00:07:26.557 --> 00:07:29.026
The protector of espers.

00:07:29.026 --> 00:07:31.460
That is her true form!

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:37.034
I see.

00:07:37.034 --> 00:07:38.023
C'mon, let's go!

00:07:39.237 --> 00:07:41.372
We have to break the
brainwashing and save them!

00:07:41.372 --> 00:07:42.066
R-Right...

00:07:48.312 --> 00:07:51.543
Okay... Um... King...

00:07:54.252 --> 00:07:56.914
God Fire Truck Robo Mk. II!

00:07:57.488 --> 00:07:59.724
That sort of idiotic robot can't exist!

00:07:59.724 --> 00:08:01.726
It has to be CG or an illusion!

00:08:01.726 --> 00:08:03.394
That's obvious, isn't it?!

00:08:03.394 --> 00:08:04.562
It is?

00:08:04.562 --> 00:08:07.326
He's attacking by using Hypno and
psychokinesis simultaneously!

00:08:08.299 --> 00:08:09.567
Hey, you're right!

00:08:09.567 --> 00:08:12.229
When I look using my spatial perception,
it's just a floating truck!

00:08:13.638 --> 00:08:14.730
Don't underestimate me!

00:08:24.515 --> 00:08:26.984
He changed its shape even more!

00:08:26.984 --> 00:08:28.008
H-Huh?

00:08:28.085 --> 00:08:30.019
He's able to disrupt our ESP, too?!

00:08:30.588 --> 00:08:32.623
My codename is Tim Toy.

00:08:32.623 --> 00:08:34.591
And toy is the keyword for my powers!

00:08:36.327 --> 00:08:38.887
As long as I can imagine something,
I'm unstoppable!

00:08:40.398 --> 00:08:41.194
Look out!

00:08:46.771 --> 00:08:47.371
Shiho!

00:08:47.371 --> 00:08:51.676
Strengthen your hearts,
or the illusion will beat you!

00:08:51.676 --> 00:08:53.478
That beam didn't come close to hitting you.

00:08:53.478 --> 00:08:55.173
You're the weakest one here!

00:08:55.847 --> 00:08:57.712
How dare you do that to my friend!

00:08:58.683 --> 00:08:59.884
Get out of there!

00:08:59.884 --> 00:09:02.682
I don't care about Tanizaki, but turn Shiho back!

00:09:03.654 --> 00:09:05.519
I have a barrier, so that won't work!

00:09:06.224 --> 00:09:08.920
You can't fool me! There's no way that's real!

00:09:09.427 --> 00:09:10.695
Aoi, don't!

00:09:10.695 --> 00:09:12.396
You can't resist by just psyching yourself up!

00:09:12.396 --> 00:09:15.957
I'm pissed off right now!
If you don't believe me...

00:09:17.435 --> 00:09:20.199
Then try handling a physical attack.

00:09:21.439 --> 00:09:22.599
God Missiles!

00:09:25.276 --> 00:09:28.006
If they hit you, you'll be turned into a toy, too!

00:09:33.384 --> 00:09:33.850
Dammit!

00:09:33.918 --> 00:09:34.816
Aoi!

00:09:36.053 --> 00:09:36.747
Are you okay?

00:09:36.821 --> 00:09:37.855
Damn it!

00:09:37.855 --> 00:09:40.824
I know this isn't real, but I have no strength!

00:09:40.892 --> 00:09:42.917
Do something, Naomi!

00:09:43.327 --> 00:09:45.162
This is so frustrating!
God, I am so pissed off now!

00:09:45.162 --> 00:09:48.154
Still... You're kind of cute.

00:09:48.599 --> 00:09:51.500
Now you're the last of The Children.

00:09:52.169 --> 00:09:54.933
Quit wasting time and use it!

00:09:55.339 --> 00:09:57.500
That weird trick you used to beat Barrett!

00:09:58.843 --> 00:10:00.868
He thinks I'm Kaoru.

00:10:01.746 --> 00:10:03.043
He thinks Naomi is?

00:10:03.314 --> 00:10:04.715
Since the three of them went on the mission,

00:10:04.715 --> 00:10:07.685
it looks like he hasn't realized
Naomi's joined from another team.

00:10:07.685 --> 00:10:08.753
I see.

00:10:08.753 --> 00:10:10.888
He's probably after the Boost.

00:10:10.888 --> 00:10:13.789
Black Phantom may be monitoring this battle.

00:10:14.292 --> 00:10:16.692
What? So, he's purposely keeping
from finishing them off!

00:10:19.931 --> 00:10:21.728
If he figures out who Naomi really is,
we're in trouble.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.703
He could have stolen a limiter
from either Aoi or Shiho!

00:10:25.703 --> 00:10:26.829
But the fact that he didn't means!

00:10:27.505 --> 00:10:29.632
Doctor, how much longer?!

00:10:30.074 --> 00:10:31.108
Calm down.

00:10:31.108 --> 00:10:32.939
Whatever you do, don't fly off by yourself!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:33.945
Why not?!

00:10:33.945 --> 00:10:36.675
There'd be no point if your power's
half-exhausted when you get there!

00:10:38.783 --> 00:10:39.909
Kaoru...

00:10:42.186 --> 00:10:42.914
Naomi!

00:10:43.354 --> 00:10:46.846
That level of psychokinesis
won't be enough to beat me!

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:49.316
Naomi!

00:10:50.027 --> 00:10:53.554
Now use that boost thing of yours! Otherwise...

00:11:00.204 --> 00:11:01.603
Director Tsubomi...

00:11:01.672 --> 00:11:04.869
Don't think that you've won!
I'm wide awake today!

00:11:05.476 --> 00:11:08.479
Who are you? This isn't your fight,
so stay out of it!

00:11:08.479 --> 00:11:09.814
Like hell I will!

00:11:09.814 --> 00:11:11.338
Really? Okay, then...

00:11:19.657 --> 00:11:20.825
They call her a ferocious woman.
Wild boar hot pot is called botan nabe.

00:11:20.825 --> 00:11:23.919
Wild boar hot pot is called botan nabe.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.921
Come over. I'll make some tea.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.501
Who are you?

00:11:30.501 --> 00:11:32.162
This isn't your fight, so stay out of it!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.672
Aoi! Shiho!

00:11:41.178 --> 00:11:43.681
Stop it! If you don't...

00:11:43.681 --> 00:11:45.483
You'll what? Kill me?

00:11:45.483 --> 00:11:49.283
Do it, if you can. It's all part of the game!

00:11:54.125 --> 00:11:56.889
If we don't do something,
Aoi and Shiho will die!

00:11:57.395 --> 00:12:01.058
This child's been eaten away
to his core by Black Phantom!

00:12:01.832 --> 00:12:06.701
I don't have the power to save him.
If Kaoru doesn't make it, then...

00:12:08.305 --> 00:12:08.862
Granny!

00:12:15.613 --> 00:12:16.847
Forgive me.

00:12:16.847 --> 00:12:19.338
This is the only way to save those two!

00:12:19.884 --> 00:12:22.751
No room in the lifeboat, this time.

00:12:24.088 --> 00:12:25.156
Granny, wait!

00:12:25.156 --> 00:12:27.358
There has to be some other way!

00:12:27.358 --> 00:12:29.427
This is the only choice!

00:12:29.427 --> 00:12:30.189
But!

00:12:32.163 --> 00:12:35.223
Don't move! Queen Of Catastrophe!

00:12:35.766 --> 00:12:37.063
No... Kaoru!

00:12:37.501 --> 00:12:41.267
Giving up on this child would be
giving up on the future!

00:12:42.973 --> 00:12:45.407
That future can't be allowed to happen!

00:12:46.277 --> 00:12:46.811
Goodbye.

00:12:46.811 --> 00:12:49.246
Director! Please, let him go!

00:12:49.246 --> 00:12:52.483
Killing that boy would be the
same as helping Black Phantom!

00:12:52.483 --> 00:12:53.313
Minamoto!

00:12:54.051 --> 00:12:59.785
For the future of both espers and Normals,
we can't yield to Black Phantom!

00:13:00.191 --> 00:13:01.385
Minamoto!

00:13:01.792 --> 00:13:03.127
Minamoto...

00:13:03.127 --> 00:13:05.391
Yeah! Mr. Minamoto's right!

00:13:06.063 --> 00:13:07.631
Save that boy!

00:13:07.631 --> 00:13:10.367
Don't worry! I know Kaoru will come!

00:13:10.367 --> 00:13:11.802
What are you saying?!

00:13:11.802 --> 00:13:14.605
We'll look after ourselves till she does!

00:13:14.605 --> 00:13:17.074
She's warping space to bend light away!

00:13:17.074 --> 00:13:19.338
Is she trying to hold back the
visual effects of his hypnosis?!

00:13:19.643 --> 00:13:21.112
Don't be stupid!

00:13:21.112 --> 00:13:23.514
Your life functions have already
been weakened by him!

00:13:23.514 --> 00:13:25.716
You won't last more than
5 or 6 minutes doing that!

00:13:25.716 --> 00:13:27.809
Don't worry! Kaoru will be here soon!

00:13:28.352 --> 00:13:30.786
Aoi! Shiho! I'm coming!

00:13:32.223 --> 00:13:33.524
What are you planning?!

00:13:33.524 --> 00:13:35.025
To help them!

00:13:35.025 --> 00:13:35.860
Huh?

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.488
We're already heading there, right?

00:13:38.929 --> 00:13:41.090
I get you. You've turned into a bad ass, huh?

00:13:41.432 --> 00:13:45.536
If we can't give them support,
what's the point of us being here?

00:13:45.536 --> 00:13:46.195
Minamoto!

00:13:46.403 --> 00:13:49.140
Okay! No time to ask permission for this.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.775
We'll just write apologies later.

00:13:50.775 --> 00:13:52.208
Don't worry, guys!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.237
Everyone's getting saved today! Friend and foe!

00:13:54.912 --> 00:13:57.676
If everyone works together, we can do this!

00:13:57.882 --> 00:13:58.871
Right!

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:02.653
God, they're so naive.

00:14:02.653 --> 00:14:05.383
What's going on? You won't use the boost?

00:14:05.823 --> 00:14:08.883
Then you'd better be ready
to take me down for real!

00:14:15.499 --> 00:14:17.201
The damage was repaired!

00:14:17.201 --> 00:14:19.336
Well, it's an illusion, after all.

00:14:19.336 --> 00:14:22.106
Anyway, we need to buy some
time till Kaoru gets here!

00:14:22.106 --> 00:14:22.765
Right!

00:14:23.007 --> 00:14:26.272
What are you babbling about?
Take the game more seriously!

00:14:27.878 --> 00:14:29.947
Aim for the robot's eyes!

00:14:29.947 --> 00:14:32.973
No way is that old, reimported
robot making a fool of us!

00:14:33.517 --> 00:14:34.518
What was that?

00:14:34.518 --> 00:14:36.787
Don't insult God Fire Truck Robo!

00:14:36.787 --> 00:14:40.257
Only kindergarteners play with
lame toys like that in Japan!

00:14:40.257 --> 00:14:43.693
Our nation's toys are much
more evolved! Like this!

00:14:43.761 --> 00:14:45.956
1/6 Scale Power-Up Suit Naomi
Custom Design by Takashi Kugutsu

00:14:47.431 --> 00:14:49.733
I paid Kugutsu to make it for me before he...

00:14:49.733 --> 00:14:51.394
Don't make weird things like that!

00:14:52.469 --> 00:14:53.731
What do you think is happening outside?

00:14:54.438 --> 00:14:56.607
No light or sound can get in here.

00:14:56.607 --> 00:14:59.710
It seems like Granny and
Naomi are giving it their best.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.803
Mr. Tanizaki's kind of getting in the way, though.

00:15:03.113 --> 00:15:05.015
This is a really powerful illusion.

00:15:05.015 --> 00:15:07.618
I'm trying to ignore it, but it's spreading.

00:15:07.618 --> 00:15:09.415
If it reaches my heart, I'm out.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.922
Dammit, it's so hard to breathe!

00:15:11.922 --> 00:15:13.457
Hang in there, Aoi!

00:15:13.457 --> 00:15:17.257
If we die before Kaoru gets here, she wins!

00:15:21.665 --> 00:15:24.468
Isn't the sunset pretty, Minamoto?

00:15:24.468 --> 00:15:25.264
Yeah.

00:15:25.736 --> 00:15:28.572
They're still alive, right, Minamoto?

00:15:28.572 --> 00:15:31.006
Yes, inside of our hearts.

00:15:31.709 --> 00:15:34.078
Let's live the happy life they'll never have!

00:15:34.078 --> 00:15:36.512
Yes, and I'll love you more to
make up for what they lost.

00:15:36.647 --> 00:15:39.016
I am SO pissed off by how wrong that is!

00:15:39.016 --> 00:15:41.518
I won't allow her to hog all
the happiness for herself!

00:15:41.518 --> 00:15:43.884
Friendship between women is complicated.
She wouldn't get here late
on purpose, would she?!

00:15:44.188 --> 00:15:47.157
Those two will reach their limit soon.
What should we do?

00:15:47.291 --> 00:15:48.349
He'll have to die...

00:15:53.063 --> 00:15:54.587
Sorry for the wait!

00:15:55.466 --> 00:15:56.467
Kaoru!

00:15:56.467 --> 00:15:59.570
It took forever to get a taxi to pick me up!

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:00.537
Kaoru!

00:16:01.138 --> 00:16:03.072
Dude, I need your plane.

00:16:03.607 --> 00:16:04.665
Wait! What are you?!

00:16:04.909 --> 00:16:06.809
Here we go!

00:16:10.214 --> 00:16:11.579
Mine's cooler!

00:16:13.317 --> 00:16:15.308
Eat this!

00:16:21.458 --> 00:16:24.052
I don't think a written apology
is going to cover that.

00:16:25.562 --> 00:16:28.122
Why, you! My God Fire Truck Robo!

00:16:28.699 --> 00:16:30.098
Kaoru!
Are you two all right?!

00:16:30.601 --> 00:16:32.330
I'm sorry I wasn't with you!

00:16:32.536 --> 00:16:34.800
Aoi! Shiho! I'm sorry!

00:16:35.139 --> 00:16:38.075
You had me worried, Melos!
As long as you're back with me!

00:16:38.075 --> 00:16:39.977
She admitted how she felt already.

00:16:39.977 --> 00:16:41.774
And I was gonna tell on her to Kaoru later.

00:16:42.146 --> 00:16:43.374
Who are you?!

00:16:44.381 --> 00:16:48.215
How dare you toy with my teammates!

00:16:50.054 --> 00:16:52.955
C'mon, that was pretty good, right? Right?

00:16:53.157 --> 00:16:54.291
Sure. Clever.

00:16:54.291 --> 00:16:55.155
Right, right.

00:16:55.626 --> 00:16:59.029
The three of us are the full
members of The Children!

00:16:59.029 --> 00:17:01.065
What? Liar!

00:17:01.065 --> 00:17:03.533
They only make figures of the main character!

00:17:04.335 --> 00:17:05.469
Figures?

00:17:05.469 --> 00:17:07.538
Fool! That isn't true any...

00:17:07.538 --> 00:17:08.630
Shut up!

00:17:09.907 --> 00:17:11.342
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:17:11.342 --> 00:17:13.477
Just try out that boost of yours already!

00:17:13.477 --> 00:17:15.536
We were going to, anyway!

00:17:15.779 --> 00:17:17.406
Mr. Minamoto!

00:17:17.715 --> 00:17:20.513
You people who are controlling
this child! Do you hear me?!

00:17:23.153 --> 00:17:26.190
Do you think that getting the
booster will make you invincible?

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.956
Or are you afraid that all the espers
in the world will link their powers?!

00:17:30.961 --> 00:17:32.896
Because no matter how
many brainwashed espers...

00:17:32.896 --> 00:17:35.057
you send after us,
we're going to free all of them!

00:17:36.734 --> 00:17:39.470
I'll remember that, boy.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:43.173
That's enough. Tell Tim to finish this.

00:17:43.173 --> 00:17:43.639
Yes.

00:17:44.675 --> 00:17:46.734
Yes, Black Phantom.

00:17:51.749 --> 00:17:52.683
Cool!

00:17:52.683 --> 00:17:54.310
Not now!

00:17:55.586 --> 00:17:56.553
Let's go.

00:17:56.553 --> 00:17:58.180
What? You're running?

00:17:58.789 --> 00:17:59.690
You dope!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:03.285
Getting out of your range will
turn them back to normal!

00:18:03.694 --> 00:18:04.661
You won't escape!

00:18:04.995 --> 00:18:06.463
Naomi, come down.

00:18:06.463 --> 00:18:08.021
I'll try to slow him down with ECM.

00:18:08.665 --> 00:18:11.190
He's so dependable.

00:18:11.769 --> 00:18:13.634
So unlike my supervisor...

00:18:13.904 --> 00:18:15.439
Hey! What are you doing?
Get away from him, Naomi!

00:18:15.439 --> 00:18:17.600
Shut up! Who cares what I do?!
Hey! What are you doing?
Get away from him, Naomi!

00:18:18.075 --> 00:18:20.509
Don't assume you can stop me with that!

00:18:29.086 --> 00:18:30.254
We're back!

00:18:30.254 --> 00:18:31.055
Thank goodness!

00:18:31.055 --> 00:18:31.987
Here he comes!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.255
STOP!

00:18:34.725 --> 00:18:38.529
The Children! Triple Boost! Full release!

00:18:38.529 --> 00:18:39.018
< < FULL RELEASE> >
The Children! Triple Boost! Full release!

00:18:41.832 --> 00:18:43.834
Who do you kiss?

00:18:43.834 --> 00:18:46.437
Do you remember love?

00:18:46.437 --> 00:18:48.462
The galaxy is calling me!

00:18:48.872 --> 00:18:51.175
Highway to the danger zone!

00:18:51.175 --> 00:18:52.870
YF-10 years old!

00:18:53.811 --> 00:18:54.645
The Absolutely...

00:18:54.645 --> 00:18:55.412
Lovely...

00:18:55.412 --> 00:18:56.709
Children!

00:18:57.014 --> 00:18:58.072
Eat this!

00:19:05.289 --> 00:19:06.457
Dammit!

00:19:06.457 --> 00:19:10.894
But no matter how this game goes
you either use the boost or kill me!

00:19:11.261 --> 00:19:13.897
Either way, I don't lose!

00:19:13.897 --> 00:19:14.886
Are you dumb?

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:20.859
What are you talking about?
You've been alone from the start!

00:19:22.606 --> 00:19:26.110
No matter how many toys you have,
playing by yourself is boring, right?

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.577
That's why you fight!

00:19:27.911 --> 00:19:29.913
But what do you fight for?

00:19:29.913 --> 00:19:32.541
For people that throw you away
when they're done with you?!

00:19:32.883 --> 00:19:35.647
No matter what happens,
we're the ones who won't lose!

00:19:35.986 --> 00:19:40.355
Because no matter what, we aren't alone!

00:19:42.559 --> 00:19:46.359
Even though they were practically
in tears a moment ago. Well said.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.395
Damn you!

00:19:49.066 --> 00:19:50.067
Shut up!

00:19:50.067 --> 00:19:51.625
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:52.102 --> 00:19:55.230
It's okay. I'm sure you'll make friends, too.

00:19:59.409 --> 00:20:03.846
But first, I'm paying you back for
what you did to Aoi and Shiho!

00:20:12.089 --> 00:20:14.191
A... A kick works, too?

00:20:14.191 --> 00:20:17.961
Who cares, as long as it
carries a wish to save him?

00:20:17.961 --> 00:20:20.631
But, it doesn't. It's overdoing it.

00:20:20.631 --> 00:20:21.965
You're the one overdoing it!

00:20:21.965 --> 00:20:24.101
We turn our backs for a second and
you're already cheating on us!

00:20:24.101 --> 00:20:26.262
Hands off the high school girl, you lolicon!

00:20:26.503 --> 00:20:27.971
But... I didn't do anything!

00:20:27.971 --> 00:20:29.529
I'm sorry! Forgive me! It was an impulse!

00:20:31.108 --> 00:20:33.804
Those three share a special bond.

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:39.750
A bond, huh? I'm a bit jealous.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.052
Dear Magi won't be happy about that, Major.

00:20:42.052 --> 00:20:43.754
All right, let's get going.

00:20:43.754 --> 00:20:44.345
Yes, sir.

00:20:46.523 --> 00:20:48.425
Because no matter how
many brainwashed espers...

00:20:48.425 --> 00:20:50.359
you send after us,
we're going to free all of them!

00:20:51.562 --> 00:20:53.463
What are you smirking at?

00:20:53.463 --> 00:20:57.034
Thinking dirty thoughts about
Kaoru and the others again?

00:20:57.034 --> 00:20:59.559
What do you mean by "again", Buyoyon?!

00:21:00.504 --> 00:21:01.972
Who are you calling Buyoyon?!

00:21:01.972 --> 00:21:03.373
So lame.

00:21:03.373 --> 00:21:04.208
What?!

00:21:04.208 --> 00:21:06.005
Um, I heard Magi say that!

00:21:08.145 --> 00:21:10.875
You're too emotional!

00:21:12.649 --> 00:21:15.485
As I was concentrating on
piloting the transport plane,

00:21:15.485 --> 00:21:18.113
I did not hear Lieutenant
Minamoto's instructions.

00:21:19.323 --> 00:21:22.693
Hijacking that brand new fighter was
Lieutenant Minamoto's idea alone.

00:21:22.693 --> 00:21:24.461
I had nothing to do with it!

00:21:24.461 --> 00:21:25.223
Sakaki!

00:21:25.529 --> 00:21:29.066
And so, he is prepared to pay
for the plane with his body!

00:21:29.066 --> 00:21:29.933
What? Wait? Isn't anyone going to defend me?!

00:21:29.933 --> 00:21:31.802
Do you have any idea what one
of those things costs?!
What? Wait? Isn't anyone going to defend me?!

00:21:31.802 --> 00:21:32.436
Do you have any idea what one
of those things costs?!

00:21:32.436 --> 00:21:33.503
There was no choice...

00:21:33.503 --> 00:21:37.174
Don't worry! Minamoto's tough!
He'll work it all off.

00:21:37.174 --> 00:21:39.142
Director, please wake up!

00:21:40.077 --> 00:21:42.637
Is this all the bond of friendship means?

00:21:42.713 --> 00:21:43.947
Don't be silly.

00:21:43.947 --> 00:21:45.676
Isn't this what that is?

00:21:47.251 --> 00:21:52.122
With a 10 billion yen debt, Koichi
Minamoto is now government property.

00:21:52.122 --> 00:21:53.824
We'll be together for the rest of our lives!

00:21:53.824 --> 00:21:56.293
Don't toy with peoples' lives!

00:21:56.293 --> 00:21:58.362
Hey! I just said something like that!

00:21:58.362 --> 00:21:59.624
I'm not making a pun!

00:22:01.265 --> 00:22:03.734
Wait. How is toy a pun?

00:22:03.734 --> 00:22:05.565
You didn't realize that when you said it?!

00:22:07.971 --> 00:22:09.996
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:20.951 --> 00:22:24.554
Mae wo muite Yume wo daite

00:22:24.554 --> 00:22:28.525
Kokoro kimete Miageru sora

00:22:28.525 --> 00:22:34.598
Mirai wo koeru Watashi no tsubasa de

00:22:34.598 --> 00:22:38.502
Anata dake ga daihon'me!

00:22:38.502 --> 00:22:42.439
Zettai love! Sengen shita

00:22:42.439 --> 00:22:48.344
Kira-kira shiteta kisetsu ga sugiteku

00:22:49.079 --> 00:22:53.116
Kinen shashin no anata wa

00:22:53.116 --> 00:22:57.018
Kawaranai komarikao

00:22:57.621 --> 00:23:03.856
Yasashikutte atatakakute namida ga dechau

00:23:05.062 --> 00:23:08.632
Ashita mo koko de aeru mitai ni

00:23:08.632 --> 00:23:12.202
Yakusoku shinaide yukou

00:23:12.202 --> 00:23:16.139
Itsumo no you ni sarigenaku

00:23:16.139 --> 00:23:21.372
Egao de chiisaku te wo futta

00:23:22.412 --> 00:23:27.213
"Jaa... Mata ne"

00:23:40.664 --> 00:23:41.164
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.164 --> 00:23:42.032
Next Episode
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.032 --> 00:23:42.766
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.766 --> 00:23:44.893
Carry, is that you?

00:23:44.968 --> 00:23:46.002
Why are you here?

00:23:46.002 --> 00:23:48.872
I don't know, but I missed you, Koichi.

00:23:48.872 --> 00:23:50.635
Minamoto, who's that woman?!

00:23:50.841 --> 00:23:52.008
Mr. Minamoto, you creep!

00:23:52.008 --> 00:23:53.510
We're not letting you off for this!

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:55.412
This isn't any business of little kids!

00:23:55.412 --> 00:23:56.747
Little kids?!

00:23:56.747 --> 00:23:58.181
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.181 --> 00:24:01.918
Episode 42: "The Oddly Perfect Couple!
Caroline, A Destined Reunion."

00:24:01.918 --> 00:24:06.218
Koichi, when I'm an adult,
and even bigger, will you marry me?

00:24:06.456 --> 00:24:06.656
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.656 --> 00:24:08.558
The Oddly Perfect Couple!
Caroline, A Destined Reunion
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.558 --> 00:24:09.957
